    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Beloved leadership and attentive staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dr. Dodson is widely praised by long-term clients for his kind demeanor, deep clinical experience, and gentle bedside manner with dogs and cats. Many pet parents emphasize that he explains conditions thoroughly without applying pressure. A small minority of reviewers report negative interactions with front desk personnel and concerns over brief examinations by newer associates."
      },
      "mentions": 39
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough explanations alongside phone difficulties"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Veterinarians receive high praise for taking unhurried time to explain pet conditions and answer questions thoroughly during consultations. Clients appreciate feeling well informed and never pressured regarding care plans. On the other hand, multiple reviewers report negative experiences when calling the clinic, citing rude receptionists or unanswered telephone calls."
      },
      "mentions": 10
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Fair and accessible veterinary rates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently note that examinations, vaccinations, and routine treatments are priced fairly compared to other New York practices. Many multi-pet households appreciate being able to vaccinate several animals without facing exorbitant bills. One reviewer, however, raised concerns about inconsistent pricing quotes depending on which staff member answered."
      },
      "mentions": 9
    }
  ],
